确保自律，因为自律是你能控制的。
Make sure you discipline because you can control the discipline.

947
01:12:41,032 --> 01:12:43,332
其次，是工作伦理。
Then, work ethic.

948
01:12:44,832 --> 01:12:47,932
非常关键，你必须努力工作。
Very, very crucial to make sure that you work hard.

949
01:12:48,732 --> 01:12:49,932
交易不会轻松。
Trading is not going to be easy.

950
01:12:49,932 --> 01:12:51,532
这不是朝九晚五的工作。
