951
01:12:51,932 --> 01:12:54,632
这不是你可以懈怠的工作。
It's not a job where you can just slack.

952
01:12:55,432 --> 01:12:58,732
你是唯一决定自己赚多少的人。
You're the only one that determines how much you make in this job.

953
01:12:58,932 --> 01:13:02,132
你自己决定在这行要走多远。
You're the only one that determines how far you want to go in this job.

954
01:13:02,132 --> 01:13:06,732
没人会推你，所以从第一天起就得拼命工作。
There's no one to push you. So you have to be willing to work hard from day one.

955
01:13:07,332 --> 01:13:08,873
当你觉得自己在偷懒时，
