964
01:13:49,332 --> 01:13:51,632
你必须学会在这个行业里保持耐心。
You're going to have to learn to be patient in this job.

965
01:13:52,132 --> 01:13:56,032
市场奖励耐心的人，惩罚急躁的人。
The markets reward patient people and they take from impatient people.

966
01:13:57,532 --> 01:13:59,732
